  "title": "RYANAIR WELCOMES DISRUPTIVE PASSENGER CONVICTION BY POLISH COURT",
  "summary": "REAFFIRMING RYANAIR’S ZERO TOLERANCE POLICY ON PASSENGER MISCONDUCT Ryanair, Europe’s No.1 airline, today (Thurs, 6 Aug) welcomed the decision of the District Court for Poznań–Grunwald and Jeżyce to convict a passenger who disrupted flight FR954 from Palma de Mallorca to Poznań on 8 June 2025. This passenger was found guilty and received a fine of PLN 3,000 as well being ordered to pay PLN 2,500 directly to the affected crew member. Ryanair is committed to […]",
